2 CONT * Bosworth 1968, p. 62-65.
2 CONT * Runciman, Steve (1992). The First Crusade. Cambridge University Press.
2 CONT * Norwich, John Julius (1993). Byzantium The Apogee. Penguin. ISBN 0-14-011448-3.
2 CONT * R. Scott Peoples (2007). Crusade of Kings. Wildside Press LLC. p. 13. ISBN 978-0-8095-7221-2.
2 CONT
