2 CONT After the death of Sultan Tughril Beg, Amid al-Mulk al-Kunduri set up on the throne of the sultanate Sulayman, the son of Da'ud Chaghri Beg, whom his uncle Sultan Tughril Beg had recognized as heir to his power, and whose mother T
