1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * from [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rustam_I '''Wikipedia'''], the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Rustam I''' (Persian: رستم‎), was the ninth ruler of the Bavand dynasty from 867 to 896. He was the successor and son (or grandson) of Qarin I.
