2 CONT * Bosworth, C. E. (1968). "The Political and Dynastic History of the Iranian World (A.D. 1000–1217)". In Frye, R. N. The Cambridge History of Iran, Volume 5: The Saljuq and Mongol periods. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press. pp
2 CONC . 1–202. ISBN 0-521-06936-X.
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. Edmund (1984). "AḤMAD B. NEẒĀM-AL-MOLK". Encyclopaedia Iranica, Vol. I, Fasc. 6. London et al.: C. Edmund Bosworth. pp. 642–643.
2 CONT * Nizam, al-Mulk (2002). The Book of Government Or Rules for Kings: The Siyar Al Muluk Or Siyasat-nama of Nizam Al-Mulk. Nizam al-Mulk. pp. 1–264. ISBN 0700712283.
2 CONT
2 CONT =External links=
