2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Constantine-IX-Monomachos-Byzantine-Emperor/385935664970005621?through=6000000000437345129 Mistress (2): (after 1044) GORANDUXT of Georgia, daughter of GIORGI I King of Georgia & [his wife Mariam of Vas
2 CONC purakan]. ... ...
