2 CONT
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. E. (1968). "The Political and Dynastic History of the Iranian World (A.D. 1000–1217)". In Frye, R. N. The Cambridge History of Iran, Volume 5: The Saljuq and Mongol periods. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press. pp
2 CONC . 1–202. ISBN 0-521-06936-X.
2 CONT * Janine and Dominique Sourdel, Historical Dictionary of Islam, Éd. PUF, ISBN 978-2-13-054536-1, article Kakuyids, pp. 452–453.
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. Edmund (1998). "KĀKUYIDS". Encyclopaedia Iranica, Vol. XV, Fasc. 4. London et al. pp. 359–362.
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. Edmund (1983). "ABŪ MANṢŪR FARĀMARZ". Encyclopaedia Iranica, Vol. I, Fasc. 3. London et al. pp. 335–336.
2 CONT * Brill (1993). "E. J. Brill's First Encyclopaedia of Islam, 1913-1936, Bind 4". pp. 1–611. ISBN 9004097902 http://books.google.dk/books?id=7CP7fYghBFQC&dq=Khusrau+Firuz+encyclopedia+of+islam&hl=da&source=gbs_navlinks_s. Missing o
2 CONC r empty |title= (help)
