2 CONT [edit]Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Constantine Monomachos was married three times:
2 CONT
2 CONT to a wife of unknown identity.
2 CONT
2 CONT to Helena Sklerina, daughter of Basil Sklerus and niece of Emperor Romanus III
2 CONT
2 CONT to the Empress Zoe
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of his second wife, Constantine also took her niece Maria Skleraine as his mistress.
2 CONT
