1 NOTE Zoe married Constantine IX after the deposition of Michael IV from the throne.
2 CONT His rule was plagued with wars and his empire suffered.
2 CONT After Zoe died he married the daughter of a mistress, Maria Skleraina, Ana nSkleraina.
2 CONT The Oxford Dictionary of Byzantium: Oxford Univ Press 1991.
2 CONT Michael Psellus, Chronographia, New Haven: Yale University Press, 1953 Vol 1,2,3,4,5,6,7
2 CONT http://www.fordam.edu/halsall/basis/psellus-chrono-02.html
