1 NOTE {geni:about_me} from the English Wikipedia:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Prince Zurab''' (Georgian: ზურაბი) (died 1125) was a Georgian royal prince of the Bagrationi dynasty.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Zurab was a second son of King David IV of Georgia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Zurab was a co-king when he was only a child but died in 1125 without ever getting married.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References===
