1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=14433 '''Li Chengxiu''' 李承休] [14433] CBD has Chengxiu as a son of a Weiqin [14434], who is listed as a grandson of Tao(5) [14429]. However, Zhou(1) Bida has Cheng
2 CONC xiu as a son of Tao(5), which is also consistant with the generational names of Tao's younger brother, Huan [14430], and with chronological logic. I keep Weiqin as a grandson of Tao and Chengxiu as a son of Tao, which would sugges
2 CONC t segementation in the generation of Zhongbao [14435], which would also be in accord with the move of Jinggui [14436] et. al. to Juye county. CBD, 2, 993. — [https://www.geni.com/projects/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
