1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * from [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gilanshah '''Wikipedia'''], the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gilanshah''' (Persian: شاه گیلان) was the last ruler of the Ziyarid dynasty from ca. 1087 to 1090. He was the son and successor of Keikavus. Little is known about Gilanshah; his kingdom was invaded by the Nizari Ismaili state i
2 CONC n 1090, ending Ziyarid rule in Tabaristan.
