1 NOTE {geni:about_me} During his Balkan Campaigns, Emperor Maurice and his family were murdered by Phocas in November 602 after a mutiny.[12] Khosrau II (Chosroes) of the Sassanid Empire had been restored to his throne by Maurice, and t
2 CONC hey had remained allies.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Thus, the Persian King Khosrau II seized the pretext to attack the Byzantine Empire and reconquer the Byzantine province of Mesopotamia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Khosrau had at his court a man who claimed to be Maurice's son Theodosius, and Khosrau demanded that the Byzantines accept this Theodosius as Emperor.
