2 CONT * From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Terken Khatun''' also known as '''Turkan Khatun''' ("the Queen of the Turks") was the Empress of the Khwarazmian Empire as the wife of Shah Ala ad-Din Tekish, and the mother of Muhammad II of the Khwarazmian Empire.[1]
