2 CONT The name and parentage of Sahak's wife is not stated in the sources, but Cyrille Tourmanoff suggests that she could be the daughter of Gourgen II of Tao, while Christian Settipani postulates that she is the maternal niece of Katch
2 CONC 'ik Gagik of Vaspourakan. See C. Settipani, ''Continue des Elites a Byzance Durant les Siecles Obscures'', page 545.
