1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Source 1: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maria_(daughter_of_Maurice)
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 2: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maurice_(emperor)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT [117] Maurice made his son Theodosius a Caesar and held a grand ceremony [g281]  with the patriarch placing the crown on his head. The same year [590-591] the Persian  prince Vahram [Choben] revolted against Khosrov. Khosrov was f
2 CONC rightened and went to  Edessa. From there he sent to Maurice asking him to be his father and help him to  [rejtake Persia. Maurice sent Thracian and Armenian troops which took and established  him on his throne. They returned with
2 CONC  gifts and the Persians returned to the Romans  Dara and Ras al-Ayn. Maurice gave his daughter Maria in marriage to Khosrov, sending  her along with bishops and priests. Khosrov built three churches in Persia for his wife  and the
2 CONC  patriarch of Antioch went and blessed them. One was named for the Mother of  God, one for the Holy Apostles, and the third for Saint Sargis. And great peace  prevailed.
2 CONT
2 CONT Chroniclesof Michael the great patriarch of Syria - page 117 https://archive.org/stream/ChronicleOfMichaelTheGreatPatriarchOfTheSyrians/Chronicle_Michael_Syrian_djvu.txt
