2 CONC te of the four regions" (sifang haojie) and "capital bureaucratic lineages" (jingdu shizu). Di(1) Zundu's  [7067] and Wei(5) Yan's [7390] son-in-law (twice: sororate), Huang(2) Shuao's [856] father-in-law. Qin Guan, WJ, Hou, 'xia,
2 CONC ' v8b; XCB, 371.19b, 376.3b, 377.2b, 384.4a, 398.6b-7a, 399.13a, 403.20a, 406.13b, 407.6a, 414.8a, 438.1a; XCBSB, 5.21b; SHY:ZG, 44.36b-37a; SHY:SH, 49.22a; SS, 344.5b; Su Song, WJ, 55.17a-23a. CBD, 2, 869-70.See Huang(2) Tingji
2 CONC an's [7111] funerary inscription for his sister's daughter's husband, Song(2) Ban [15402]. CBD, 2, 916. — [https://www.geni.com/projects/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
