1 CONT
1 CONT Mosaic of Constantine IX and Empress ZoeConstantine IX Monomachus (c.1000 - January 11, 1055) reigned as Byzantine emperor from June 11,1042 to January 11, 1055. He had been chosen by Zoë as a husband andco-emperor in 1042, althou
