1 CONT Ashot II the Iron (yerkat) (ruled 914 - 928) was the son of King Smbat I. His reign was filled with rebellions by pretenders to the throne, and foreign invasions, which Ashot fought off successfully. This is how he got the epithet
1 CONC  the Iron. In 914, Ashot II visited Constantinople to get aid from Byzantine Emperor Constantine Porphyrogenitus. He returned to Armenia with large aid, and crushed the Arab harassment of his lands by Yusuf. He was married to Mari
1 CONC e of Kachum.
0 @N6000000002187821526@ NOTE Abas I of Armenia
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Abas I of Armenia 
1 CONT King 
1 CONT Reign Armenia: 928 - 953 
